# Public repository privacy

Follow the **Public repository: privacy and secrets** section of [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)
for every change, commit and push, including tests, examples and documentation.
Use only invented identities, device names, paths and project names. Never copy real connection
details, credentials or real SSH key material into tracked content. Review staged content and
outgoing commit metadata; secret scanning alone does not detect all personal information.
Use the repository-local neutral commit identity specified in AGENTS.md.
